title: "MSATK: Multiple Sequence Alignment Toolkit"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-05-14
authors:
  - family-names: Lucaci
    given-names: Alexander
license: MIT
abstract: "MSATK provides a reproducible command-line and Python framework for summarizing, validating, visualizing, and reporting multiple sequence alignments across nucleotide, protein, and codon-aware use cases."
